---
import HomeDownloader from './react/HomeDownloader.jsx';
import TrendingDownloads from './TrendingDownloads.astro';
import FAQItem from './FAQItem.astro';
import { ui } from '../data/i18n.js';

const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const t = { ...ui.en, ...ui[lang] };

const FAQS = [
  { q: t['faq.q1'] || "Is this downloader free?", a: t['faq.a1'] || "Yes, our service is 100% free with no hidden charges or premium subscriptions." },
  { q: t['faq.q2'] || "Do I need to create an account?", a: t['faq.a2'] || "No, you can download any public content anonymously without sign-up." },
  { q: t['faq.q3'] || "Which platforms are supported?", a: t['faq.a3'] || "We support Instagram, YouTube, Facebook, TikTok, Pinterest, and X (Twitter)." },
  { q: t['faq.q4'] || "Is there a download limit?", a: t['faq.a4'] || "No, you can download an unlimited number of videos and images every day." }
];
---

<div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-6 py-5">
  <HomeDownloader client:load lang={lang} />

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-24 mt-16">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-6" style="color:var(--txt);">{t['home.why_h2']} <span class="text-[var(--brand)]">{t['home.why_brand']}</span></h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--txt2)] text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
        {t['home.why_p']}
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[rgba(124,58,237,0.1)] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">🚀</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold mb-1" style="color:var(--txt);">{t['home.instant_speed']}</h4>
            <p class="text-sm opacity-60">{t['home.instant_speed_p']}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[rgba(236,72,153,0.1)] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">🔒</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold mb-1" style="color:var(--txt);">{t['home.private']}</h4>
            <p class="text-sm opacity-60">{t['home.private_p']}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative p-8 rounded-[32px] border border-[var(--bdr)] overflow-hidden" style="background:var(--bg-glass);">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4" style="color:var(--txt);">{t['home.multi_device_h3']}</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--txt2)] leading-relaxed">
          {t['home.multi_device_p']}
        </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-12 text-center" style="color:var(--txt);">{t['common.faq']}</h2>
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto space-y-4 mb-20">
      {FAQS.map(faq => <FAQItem q={faq.q} a={faq.a} />)}
    </div>

    <!-- Universal Rich SEO Content Section — Resolves homepage thin content risk -->
    <div class="seo-content-section mt-24 pt-16 border-t border-[var(--bdr)]">
      
      <section aria-labelledby="home-about-heading">
        <h2 id="home-about-heading" class="seo-section-heading">All-in-One Multi-Platform Social Media Downloader</h2>
        <p class="seo-p">
          <strong>InstaDownloader</strong> is a state-of-the-art, universal web application built to simplify the process of saving media from the world's most popular social media networks. As digital sharing continues to evolve, high-quality videos, high-resolution photography, short-form clips, and interactive creative pins have become integral to how we communicate, learn, and preserve memories. However, most social platforms do not offer native, direct offline saving features due to corporate silos or advertising monetization structures. InstaDownloader bridges this gap by acting as an independent, lightning-fast media gateway, enabling users to convert and download their favorite public posts, reels, shorts, stories, and feed boards securely.
        </p>
        <p class="seo-p">
          Whether you are looking to download a stunning nature portrait from Pinterest, save a highly educational tutorial from YouTube, preserve an engaging video loop from X (formerly Twitter), or archive an original audio-tracked Reel from Instagram for presentation purposes, our platform offers a unified, single-field interface that handles every media request seamlessly. We operate entirely within your web browser, eliminating the need to install third-party plugins, desktop executables, or insecure mobile applications that compromise your personal privacy or device storage.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="home-networks-heading">
        <h2 id="home-networks-heading" class="seo-section-heading">Supported Networks & Direct Core Downloader Portals</h2>
        <p class="seo-p">
          Our downloader is structured to support six major platforms, each fine-tuned to pull the highest possible quality directly from the CDN networks. You can access the dedicated downloader nodes here:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 my-8">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--bdr)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-glass-h)] transition-all" style="background:var(--bg-glass);">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">📸</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2" style="color:var(--txt);">Instagram Downloader</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed opacity-60 mb-4" style="color:var(--txt3);">
              Preserves public IG Reels, feed carousels, HD posts, and temporary public stories before they expire.
            </p>
            <a href="/instagram" class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--brand2)] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              Go to Instagram Downloader →
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--bdr)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-glass-h)] transition-all" style="background:var(--bg-glass);">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">📺</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2" style="color:var(--txt);">YouTube Downloader</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed opacity-60 mb-4" style="color:var(--txt3);">
              Extracts full-length video guides, vertical YouTube Shorts, and pulls high-bitrate MP3 tracks from your favorite playlists.
            </p>
            <a href="/yt" class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--brand2)] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              Go to YouTube Downloader →
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--bdr)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-glass-h)] transition-all" style="background:var(--bg-glass);">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🎵</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2" style="color:var(--txt);">TikTok Downloader</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed opacity-60 mb-4" style="color:var(--txt3);">
              Saves TikTok clips in original resolution without the bouncing logo watermark, making editing and cross-posting easy.
            </p>
            <a href="/tiktok" class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--brand2)] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              Go to TikTok Downloader →
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--bdr)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-glass-h)] transition-all" style="background:var(--bg-glass);">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🎬</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2" style="color:var(--txt);">Facebook Downloader</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed opacity-60 mb-4" style="color:var(--txt3);">
              Processes public Watch videos, feed clips, and public FB Reels in standard definition or pristine High Definition.
            </p>
            <a href="/facebook" class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--brand2)] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              Go to Facebook Downloader →
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--bdr)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-glass-h)] transition-all" style="background:var(--bg-glass);">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">📌</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2" style="color:var(--txt);">Pinterest Downloader</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed opacity-60 mb-4" style="color:var(--txt3);">
              Downloads beautiful design ideas, step-by-step cooking recipes, loop GIFs, and high-res aesthetic inspiration boards.
            </p>
            <a href="/pinterest" class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--brand2)] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              Go to Pinterest Downloader →
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--bdr)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-glass-h)] transition-all" style="background:var(--bg-glass);">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">𝕏</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2" style="color:var(--txt);">X / Twitter Downloader</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.82rem] leading-relaxed opacity-60 mb-4" style="color:var(--txt3);">
              Saves silent MP4 files, tweet videos, and high-contrast images directly from any public thread.
            </p>
            <a href="/x" class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--brand2)] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              Go to X Downloader →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="home-steps-heading">
        <h2 id="home-steps-heading" class="seo-section-heading">How to Download from Any Social Media App</h2>
        <p class="seo-p">
          To download social media content, follow these three universally simple steps:
        </p>
        <ol>
          <li class="flex">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 mr-4">1</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Copy the Share URL</strong>
              <p>Open the respective app or website. Tap the 'Share' or 'Send' button on the post you want to save, and select 'Copy Link' to grab the unique address.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 mr-4">2</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Paste Into InstaDownloader</strong>
              <p>Return to our homepage or open the dedicated platform node. Paste the copied link directly into the search field at the top of this page.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 mr-4">3</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Generate and Save</strong>
              <p>Click 'Search' or 'Download'. Our cloud engine instantly inspects the CDN file headers, generates secure download options, and saves the file directly to your local device memory.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="home-tech-heading">
        <h2 id="home-tech-heading" class="seo-section-heading">HD Quality Preservation & Technical Excellence</h2>
        <p class="seo-p">
          InstaDownloader does not re-compress, resize, or alter the file headers of the media you download. When an artist uploads a Reel at 1080×1920 pixels or a creator uploads a YouTube Short in H.264/AAC format, our scraper communicates directly with the hosting servers to request that specific original stream. By bypassing intermediate conversion servers, we guarantee that the final MP4 or JPG file downloaded to your device possesses the exact bitrate, color profile, and audio track that the author originally intended.
        </p>
        <p class="seo-p">
          This focus on technical fidelity makes InstaDownloader the preferred choice for digital marketers, video editors, teachers, and researchers who require original-quality media for mockups, educational references, and creative mood boards. Furthermore, because our service operates globally, our system automatically selects the fastest regional edge server closest to you, providing maximum download speeds and eliminating buffering pauses.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="home-safety-heading">
        <h2 id="home-safety-heading" class="seo-section-heading">Strict Security, Privacy Standards, and Copyright Protection</h2>
        <p class="seo-p">
          Your online privacy is our highest technical priority. Unlike other online converters that force you to create an account, enter email addresses, or install external browser extensions that monitor your keystrokes, InstaDownloader is completely registration-free. We do not maintain databases of user links, nor do we track individual download histories. Every download request is processed as a stateless transaction—meaning that once your file transfer is complete, our server immediately discards all memory of the query.
        </p>
        <p class="seo-p">
          In keeping with our commitment to legal safety and creator respect, InstaDownloader operates strictly on <strong>publicly accessible media only</strong>. We respect all platform privacy settings: our system cannot bypass private profile restrictions, locked boards, or direct messages. We strongly encourage all users to respect copyright laws and intellectual property rights. InstaDownloader is designed for personal archiving, educational analysis, and backup purposes. Downloading copyrighted material without the explicit permission of the original creator is a violation of the terms of service of the respective platforms and may violate international copyright laws. Always credit the creator when sharing downloaded public media.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <TrendingDownloads lang={lang} />
  </div>
</div>
